From 7af2106236840c18bb0e4710f0d9e8742ea03848 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeiroNext <mihail.rozshko@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:20:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] d/control: Recommends libunity-gtk4-menu0 (49.4+unity2)

libunity-gtk4-menu0 is the Unity session's GTK4 global menu library, a
session-wide preload like libgtk-nocsd0, which is already recommended here.
It is our own package and nothing pulled it, so no installation got it.

Assisted-by: LLM claude-opus-5-5
Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 debian/changelog | 9 +++++++++
 debian/control   | 1 +
 2 files changed, 10 insertions(+)

diff --git a/debian/changelog b/debian/changelog
index 4796b65..19dc114 100644
--- a/debian/changelog
+++ b/debian/changelog
@@ -1,3 +1,12 @@
+unity-session (49.4+unity2) resolute; urgency=medium
+
+  * Recommends libunity-gtk4-menu0, the Unity session's GTK4 global menu
+    library, next to libgtk-nocsd0. It is our own package, not in the
+    archive, and nothing pulled it, so no Unity installation got the
+    GTK4 menu (UNITY-20260927-037).
+
+ -- Ubuntu Unity Life Support <mihail.rozshko@gmail.com>  Mon, 28 Sep 2026 08:20:14 +0000
+
 unity-session (49.4+unity1) resolute; urgency=medium
 
   * run-systemd-session: stop graphical-session.target at session start
diff --git a/debian/control b/debian/control
index fd11b67..03ea1b2 100644
--- a/debian/control
+++ b/debian/control
@@ -18,6 +18,7 @@ Depends: dbus-user-session,
          unity-settings-daemon,
          ${misc:Depends}
 Recommends: libgtk-nocsd0,
+            libunity-gtk4-menu0,
             rhythmbox-plugin-zeitgeist,
             zeitgeist-datahub
 Provides: x-session-manager
-- 
2.53.0

